<title>RUSSIA: Sayansk Aluminium 1996 div 1,000 roubles.</title>
<headline>Sayansk Aluminium 1996 div 1,000 roubles.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Sayansk Aluminium said shareholders had agreed a dividend of 1,000 roubles for 1996 on Saturday.</p>
<p>&quot;A shareholders' meeting...confirmed a decision to pay 400 percent of the nominal value of the shares,&quot; said a company statement, adding that the nominal value was 250 roubles.</p>
<p>The statement said that the company's registered capital was 1.2 billion roubles.</p>
<p>A company official contacted by telephone said profit figures for 1996 were not yet available. He was unable to say whether a dividend had been paid in 1995, when the company recorded net profit of 18.2 billion roubles, against a 1994 loss of 7.5 billion roubles.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
